# Repo conventions

```
frameworks/                 # shared ELC constants
lms/                        # Flask LMS app
  seeds/                    # verified expectations JSON
  sources/ontario-curriculum/  # Ministry PDFs
tools/math-game-show/       # live class game show (no overlay in this repo)
agents/                     # school-facing agent prompts
scripts/                    # syllabus + IMSCC helper scripts
.cursor/rules/ + skills/    # school-facing only
```

- Do **not** add `courses/` or commit `.imscc` files.
- Module packs: Admin upload → `content_libraries` on `/data`.
- Put shared school rules under `frameworks/` or `.cursor/rules/`.
- Teaching content > app scaffolding. Docstrings required on new functions/methods.
- Do not commit unless Shawn asks.
